<title>SPAIN: Spain - Revenues, expenditures through 2000.</title>
<headline>Spain - Revenues, expenditures through 2000.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are Spain's projections for the public administration's revenues and expenditures from 1997 to 2000 under the new stability pact on a national account basis and as a percentage over previous period:</p>
<p>				   '97     '98    '99    2000    Average</p>
<p>    TOTAL REVENUES	   4.9	5.9    5.7    5.3	  5.4</p>
<p>    TOTAL EXPENDITURES     1.6	4.7    4.4    4.3	  3.8</p>
<p>    - Current expend.	2.3	4.1    4.0    4.3	  3.7</p>
<p>    - Capital expend.     -4.4     10.1    8.4    4.4	  3.5</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
